---
const tools = [["ChatGPT","Obsah / Supervisor","core","Texty, brief, koordinácia"],["Leonardo AI","Obrázky","optional","Alternatíva k Nano Banana"],["Gemini","AI asistent","core","Druhý modelový provider"],["Manus","Autonómny agent","evaluate","Overiť API a bezpečnosť"],["Predis.ai","Instagram / marketing","priority","Marketing Agent"],["Kling AI","Generovanie videa","priority","Video Agent"],["Crayo","Krátke video klipy","optional","Video Clipping"],["ElevenLabs","Voiceover / hlas","priority","Voice Agent"],["Gamma","Prezentácie","optional","Presentation Agent"],["Whimsical","Diagramy","optional","Architecture Agent"],["Pikzels","Thumbnaily","optional","Náhľadové obrázky"],["Perplexity","Výskum","priority","Research Agent"],["Notion AI","Poznámky","optional","Knowledge Agent"],["Canva","Grafický dizajn","priority","Design Agent"],["HeyGen","Avatarové videá","priority","Video Agent"]].map(([name,task,priority,agent])=>({name,task,priority,agent}));
const labels = {all:'Všetky',core:'Základ',priority:'Prioritné',evaluate:'Preveriť',optional:'Voliteľné'};
---
<!doctype html><html lang="sk"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>WDFOX • AI Tool Registry</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#172332,#05090f 70%);color:#eaf4ff;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:26px 16px 80px}nav{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}nav a{color:#a2efff;border:1px solid #39546b;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none}h1{color:#a6f4ce;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem)}p{color:#b2c0ce;line-height:1.6}.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}button{background:#10202e;color:#e6f7ff;border:1px solid #3b5365;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 15px;cursor:pointer}button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#194c48;border-color:#8ceac2}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.tool{border:1px solid #344354;background:#0c151e;border-radius:15px;padding:16px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;color:inherit;width:100%}.tool:hover,.tool:focus-visible{border-color:#9bf5d1}.tool strong{display:block;font-size:1.13rem}.tool small{display:block;color:#a9b9c8;margin-top:9px}.tag{display:inline-block;color:#d6f7ee;border:1px solid #42675d;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:.73rem;margin:10px 0}.detail{margin-top:24px;padding:18px;border:1px solid #446074;border-radius:14px;background:#0e1b26}.note{border-left:3px solid #9bf5d1;padding:13px 16px;background:#0d1a22;margin-top:25px}@media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:520px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><nav><a href="/system-design">🌳 Hlavná mapa</a><a href="/system-design/image-generation">🎨 Image Agent</a><a href="/system-design/web-development">🌐 Web Development</a></nav><h1>🧰 WDFOX AI Tool Registry</h1><p>15 nástrojov z referenčného obrázka „15 AI Tools for 15 Tasks“. Návrh možných agentov a providerov — nie potvrdené integrácie. Kliknutím zobrazíš úlohu nástroja. Filtrovanie funguje priamo na stránke.</p><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filtrovať nástroje">{Object.entries(labels).map(([key,label])=><button type="button" data-filter={key} aria-pressed={key==='all'?'true':'false'}>{label}</button>)}</div><div class="grid" id="tools">{tools.map(t=><button class="tool" type="button" data-priority={t.priority} data-name={t.name} data-task={t.task} data-agent={t.agent}><strong>{t.name}</strong><span class="tag">{labels[t.priority]}</span><small>{t.task}</small><small>WDFOX: {t.agent}</small></button>)}</div><section class="detail" id="detail" aria-live="polite"><strong>Vyber nástroj</strong><p>Zobrazí sa jeho navrhovaná úloha vo WDFOX.</p></section><section class="note"><strong>Implementačné pravidlá:</strong> Pred zapojením preveriť oficiálne API, cenu, licenciu, ochranu údajov a limity. n8n smeruje úlohy, tajné kľúče ostávajú na serveri, platené generovanie a publikovanie vyžadujú schválenie. Nano Banana ostáva preferovaným Image Agentom; Leonardo AI je možná alternatíva. Žiadna z uvedených externých služieb tu nie je aktivovaná.</section></main><script>const buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]')],cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('.tool')],detail=document.querySelector('#detail');buttons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const f=b.dataset.filter;buttons.forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));cards.forEach(c=>c.hidden=f!=='all'&&c.dataset.priority!==f)}));cards.forEach(c=>c.addEventListener('click',()=>{detail.innerHTML='';const h=document.createElement('h2');h.textContent=c.dataset.name;const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent='Úloha: '+c.dataset.task+' • WDFOX: '+c.dataset.agent+'. Stav: návrh, API integrácia neoverená.';detail.append(h,p);detail.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'nearest'})}));</script></body></html>